  "label": "Monkey as anti-Black racial slur",
  "description": "The comparison of Black people to monkeys or apes is a deeply offensive racist trope with centuries of history. This dehumanizing comparison has been used to falsely portray Black people as less evolved, less intelligent, or less human. It remains one of the most harmful and persistent forms of anti-Black racism globally.",
